OL,3,GNEWSAProtesters blocking Garvaghy Road
OL,4,Aahead of Orange Order march
OL,5,
OL,6,FHundreds of protesters are blocking a
OL,7,Froad in Portadown after a contentious
OL,8,FOrange Order parade was given
OL,9,Flate-night clearance to march down it.
OL,11,FFollowing a series of legal challenges,
OL,12,Fa ruling by the Parades Commission
OL,13,Fpermitting the Drumcree parade down the
OL,14,Fmainly nationalist Garvaghy Road was
OL,15,Fupheld in an "unprecedented" sitting of
OL,16,Fthe High Court in Belfast.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,413,410,260,120,0,100
