OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAProtesters blocking Garvaghy Road
OL,4,Aahead of Orange Order march
OL,5,
OL,6,FSinn Fein leader Mary Lou McDonald and
OL,7,FStormont First Minister Michelle
OL,8,FO'Neill have joined protesters, while
OL,9,Fmembers of the Orange Order and
OL,10,FDemocratic Unionist Party (DUP)
OL,11,Fpoliticians have gathered at Drumcree,
OL,12,Fabout a mile away, waiting for the road
OL,13,Fto clear.
OL,15,FThe Drumcree parade, which sparked some
OL,16,Fof the most serious disorder in
OL,17,FNorthern Ireland's history, had been
OL,18,Fgiven permission to go ahead with
OL,19,Frestrictions for the first time in
OL,20,Falmost 30 years.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
